title: 'statement-store: deliver statements to light peers on the v2 DHT path'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    With the v2 DHT path on, the propagation plan takes the filter matches from the stored peer
    filters instead of the topology, so a light peer gets live statements after its initial sync.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
